        "median ratio of the standard deviation across sets to the binomial one: 1.47; largest range: 20; arms with a range over 12: 2",
        "arm (aliases) @ sea | sets | counts | mean | sd | binomial sd | ratio | range",
        "inc@W | 3 | 100,110,90 | 100.00 | 10.00 | 6.67 | 1.50 | 20",
        "e30@W | 3 | 106,116,97 | 106.33 | 9.50 | 6.60 | 1.44 | 19",
        "controls (not in the statistic): exact 3 sets mean 170.00 sd 0.00 range 0; long+fix+forget 3 sets mean 165.00 sd 0.00 range 0",
        "",
        "(B) THE EFFECT OF ONE FEATURE: 1 rows (feature, variant, sea) with at least one set; seen 0, suggested 1, not separable 0; the registration's grid is 9 features x 6 seas = 54, unadjusted",
        "feature | variant | sea | sets | mean effect | interval | sets + / - / 0 | call",
        "F8 | - | W | 3 | 6.33 | 4.90 to 7.77 | 3/0/0 | suggested",
        "",
        "THE PREDICTIONS",
        "PA1 MISSED: the ghost (F1) is not separable under every sea. 0 rows without the carry, 0 seen or suggested",
        "PA2 MISSED: the carry (F2) is not separable. 0 F1 rows whose ghost carries (F2 has no matched pair), 0 seen or suggested",
        "PA3 MISSED: the confirmed clear (F3) is not separable, or seen with a negative sign of at most 6. 0 rows, 0 outside",
