        "PA5 MISSED: the ramp against the step (F5) is seen with a positive effect between 8 and 20 under R3D30. no row",
        "PA6 MISSED: the first-reading near mark (F6) is seen with a negative effect of at least 15 under WD30, WD30L and W. WD30 no row; WD30L no row; W no row",
